WEBVTT

00:07:59.116 --> 00:08:01.036
it is our collective responsibility.

00:08:01.876 --> 00:08:05.796
India is a home for about 100 million
smallholder farmers.

00:08:06.836 --> 00:08:08.156
I dream of a day

00:08:08.156 --> 00:08:14.636
when "smallholder farmer" becomes
synonymous with a happy farmer,

00:08:15.516 --> 00:08:21.836
and being forced to eat mud
should never be a feature again, anywhere.

00:08:22.756 --> 00:08:23.916
Thank you.

00:08:23.916 --> 00:08:30.916
(Applause and cheers)